      "recommendedCellWorldSize": 96,
      "recommendedWalkFPS": 12,
      "fullBodyRotation": false,
      "notes": [
        "Sixteen painted upright human walk poses: head remains screen-up and boots screen-down in every facing direction.",
        "Select the anatomical direction row; never rotate or vertically flip the complete sprite. Dash ghosts must use the same upright frame.",
        "Render complete cells at one shared scale; do not rescale individual visible bounds. Default ground anchors align the boot baseline to player.x/player.y; bodyAnchor is the waist position in the same cell.",
        "96 world-pixel square cells produce about 85\u201388 world-pixel visible character height. Idle uses frame 1. Advance gait with movement speed or distance; freeze while idle.",
        "Cream short coat and exposed dark-haired head, crimson scarf, navy trousers, dark boots and brass bracer retain the original identity at small game scale.",
        "Original hero.png is preserved for the menu illustration. Rope attachment and gameplay collision remain renderer/physics responsibilities.",
        "Atlas inspected visually and by alpha bounds: all figures fit their own cells, transparent gutters separate frames, no frame is clipped. Very faint edge alpha below 16 is antialiasing, not an opaque backdrop."
      ],
      "anchorMeaning": "Ground anchor at boot baseline, positioned at player.x/player.y; bodyAnchor retained separately for attachment calculations."
    }
  }
